Common password list (senhas_comuns.txt)

The file senhas_comuns.txt is an unmodified copy of the Portuguese list of
the 150 most common passwords from SecLists:

  Repository: https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists
  File:       Passwords/Common-Credentials/Language-Specific/Portugese_Pwdb_common-password-list-top-150.txt
  Commit:     fef30127d19485fb91f390a3c8c535aefbd50047 (2025-03-22)
  SHA-256:    e827d8607d9812e0140be005fcff49d1a0a151cfa853e392127ae79d61fdaf38

SecLists took the list from Pwdb-Public
(https://github.com/ignis-sec/Pwdb-Public). Both projects fall under the MIT
License: the same terms printed above apply to the list, with the copyright
held by the authors below.

SecLists:    Copyright (c) 2018 Daniel Miessler
Pwdb-Public: Copyright (c) 2020 Ata Hakçıl
